    "id": "NRS-484B-600-1e",
    "title": "Basic rule (1)(e)",
    "text": "It is unlawful for any person to drive or operate a vehicle of any kind or character at: In any event, a rate of speed greater than 80 miles per hour.",
    "source": "NRS 484B.600(1)(e)"
